0.09(t-18)}=8\\,000e^{0.09(t-18)}.$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$P(23)=8\\,000e^{0.45}\\approx12\\,546.49748392135.$$\n\nRounding only this final value to the nearest whole number gives approximately $12\\,546$ fish."}]}
